{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the world of ruthless insects. Test yourself as a spider, a skilled hunter. Your web is your weapon. Wrap your prey in a cocoon to immobilize and eat it. Defeat the swarm of insects and become the top predator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate all enemy waves to complete the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat your prey to gain experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade active and passive skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new spider-web powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive and adapt to new enemy evolutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create unique builds of your spider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with friends.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651960?t=1745946243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651960?t=1745946243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651960/2e0938240840911176293c16da929695eb7d8e7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745946243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651960/2e0938240840911176293c16da929695eb7d8e7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745946243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the world of ruthless insects. Test yourself as a spider, a skilled hunter. Your web is your weapon. Wrap your prey in a cocoon to immobilize and eat it. Defea